<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 分类调整只影响演练厨房</view><view class="eyebrow">把拿手菜整理得顺手</view><view class="title">分类与排序</view><view class="muted">点分类展开菜谱。用上下箭头排序；编辑菜谱可以移到其他分类。隐藏只收起分类入口，菜仍会出现在「全部」。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="note">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在整理分类…</view><block wx:else><view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><view class="flex" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="expand"><view class="dish-name">{{item.name}} {{expanded===item.id?'⌃':'⌄'}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.dishes.length}} 道 · {{item.kindName}}搭配 {{item.hidden?'· 已隐藏':''}}</view></view><button size="mini" class="sort-button" disabled="{{busy||index===0}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="move" aria-label="上移{{item.name}}">↑</button><button size="mini" class="sort-button" disabled="{{busy||index===rows.length-1}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="move" aria-label="下移{{item.name}}">↓</button><button size="mini" class="sort-button" disabled="{{busy}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="menu" aria-label="管理{{item.name}}">···</button></view><block wx:if="{{expanded===item.id}}"><view class="muted" wx:if="{{!item.dishes.length}}">这个分类暂时没有菜。</view><view class="list-row" wx:for="{{item.dishes}}" wx:for-item="dish" wx:for-index="di" wx:key="id"><view class="flex" data-id="{{dish.id}}" bindtap="edit"><view>{{dish.name}}</view><view class="muted">编辑 / 移动分类 ›</view></view><button size="mini" class="sort-button" disabled="{{busy||di===0}}" data-id="{{dish.id}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="moveDish" aria-label="上移{{dish.name}}">↑</button><button size="mini" class="sort-button" disabled="{{busy||di===item.dishes.length-1}}" data-id="{{dish.id}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="moveDish" aria-label="下移{{dish.name}}">↓</button></view></block></view><button wx:if="{{!error}}" class="primary" bindtap="add" disabled="{{busy||categories.length>=20}}">＋ 新建分类</button><view class="muted footnote">分类对应的菜类用于日常搭配。调整分类与排序不会改变已发布饭局的菜单快照。</view></block></view>
